00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:14.840
which is pretty incredible.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:17.810
It's crazy because the
starting price is very close.

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:20.350
If not exactly the same
as the previous version.

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:22.710
The iPad pro 11 inches starting at $799

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:25.830
and the iPad pro 12.9
inches starting at $1099.

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:29.550
And they also have a new
white magic keyboard cover

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:32.240
which I'm very, very excited about.

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:33.810
Really the main takeaway from this

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:37.030
is this is a 5G enabled iPad

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.670
which is kind of huge.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:41.610
Especially if you're somebody
who is traveling a lot

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:44.320
or you need to be constantly
connected on your iPad.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:46.280
Normally a lot of times
you could just get away

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:48.230
with using your phone as a hotspot

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:49.696
but the fact that everything is there,

00:10:49.696 --> 00:10:53.573
color me impressed.

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:57.410
Well, guys, that was just
sort of a quick recap

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:58.877
of what happened at the Apple event today.

00:10:58.877 --> 00:11:01.160
My sister and I are also
going to be doing a podcast

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:02.960
talking about some of the
things that we saw today

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:05.760
and discussing all of our
thoughts and reactions.

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:08.476
So be sure to check that
out, youtube.com/samebrain

00:11:08.476 --> 00:11:10.886
or check out Same Brain on Apple podcasts

00:11:10.886 --> 00:11:13.480
or anywhere that you listen to podcasts.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:15.230
I look forward to seeing
you guys in my next video

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.140
and stay tuned for some
coverage on all of these things.

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:19.550
